window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A year ago, I was a normal human girl who loved hazelnut coffee and New York pizza. Now, I'm a shapeshifting wolf with an appetite for blood.<br> <br> Worse, I've been captured by the Dark Fae. Trapped in their realm, I'm forced to train at their castle and battle in their deadly games to crown the next king. But all I want to do is fight my captors instead.<br> <br> The three dangerous and incredibly seductive fae who have taken it upon themselves to make my life a living hell.<br> <br> But I'm no damsel in distress.<br> <br> Let the games begin.<br> <br> <b><i>A Cage of Moonlight</i></b><b> is the fourth full-length novel in a fantasy romance series and the first of Bree's story. Set inside the Dark Fae realm, it's packed full of danger, magic, and romance that doesn't require choosing.</b></p>"; 
